## Value working

**Show the arithmetic.** The first question will be where the number came from.

<!-- table:prioritisation.value-working role=register id=Workflow -->

| Workflow | Instances/month | Mins per instance | Loaded hourly cost | Risk effect | Revenue effect | Value at stake | Measured or assumed? |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|

Use conservative inputs. A defensible number beats an impressive one — the impressive one gets challenged, and then the whole matrix is in question.

## Feasibility working

<!-- table:prioritisation.feasibility-working role=register id=Workflow -->

| Workflow | Data availability | API coverage (verified) | Verifiability | Exception density | Political resistance | Lowest | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|

**Score API coverage as verified, not as documented** — the two differ. Score access as *provisioned*: "possible" is not "agreed", and "agreed" is not "provisioned".

